:21,"text":"如案禁錮十年超宗下廷尉一宿髮白皓首詔徙越州"},{"pdf_page":106,"half":"右","leaf":"四下","column_from_right":9,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"行至豫章上敕豫章內史虞悰曰謝超宗令於彼賜自"},{"pdf_page":106,"half":"右","leaf":"四下","column_from_right":10,"start":0,"end":6,"text":"盡勿傷其形骸"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p017","text":"詔曰：「超宗釁同大逆，罪不容誅。彖匿情欺國，愛朋罔主，事合極法，特原收治，免官如案，禁錮十年。」超宗下廷尉，一宿髮白皓首。詔徙越州，行至豫章，上敕豫章內史虞悰曰：「謝超宗令於彼賜自盡，勿傷其形骸。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p017:m0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"超宗","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p017:m0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"彖","person_id":"x6r_6az_6zn","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p017:m0048","start":48,"end":50,"surface":"超宗","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p017:m0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"虞悰","person_id":"lo2_l7i_fa4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong:p017:m0082","start":82,"end":85,"surface":"謝超宗","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_CDAABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依同句、職稱與說話角色。"}],"source_position":{"raw_start":2084,"raw_end":2183,"raw_character_offsets":[2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091,2092,2093,2094,2095,2096,2097,2098,2099,2100,2101,2102,2103,2104,2105,2106,2107,2108,2109,2110,2111,2112,2113,2114,2115,2116,2117,2118,2119,2120,2121,2122,2123,2124,2125,2126,2127,2128,2129,2130,2131,2132,2133,2134,2135,2136,2137,2138,2139,2140,2141,2142,2143,2144,2145,2146,2147,2148,2149,2150,2151,2152,2153,2154,2155,2156,2157,2158,2159,2160,2161,2162,2163,2164,2165,2166,2167,2168,2169,2170,2171,2172,2173,2174,2175,2176,2177,2178,2179,2180,2181,2182],"first_line":44,"last_line":44,"revision_id":1492438,"source_layer":"received_biography","projection_sha256":"38781ad356c16ec8713f9287c7afb84048453cda58584f5ead764916ed2e52cd"},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong","book_id":"b-nanqishu-036","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-036-xiechaozong-ws1492438"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin","text":"虞悰字景豫，會稽餘姚人也。祖嘯父，晉左民尚書。父秀之，黃門郎。","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"虞悰","kind":"person","person_id":"lo2_l7i_fa4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"景豫","kind":"person","person_id":"lo2_l7i_fa4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"嘯父","kind":"person","person_id":"a6e_72c_a59","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu:kin:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"秀之","kind":"person","person_id":"add_0d9_001","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","source_quote":{"witness":"qi","quote":"虞悰字景豫，會稽餘姚人也。祖嘯父，晉左民尚書。父秀之，黃門郎。","raw_start":3763,"raw_end":3794,"raw_line":59},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-037","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-037-jin076-yuxiaofu"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p064","text":"　　永明十年，稚珪及光祿大夫陸澄、祠部尚書虞悰、太子右率沈約、司徒右長史張融表薦京產曰：「竊見吳郡杜京產，潔靜爲心，謙虛成性，通和發於天挺，敏達表於自然。學徧玄、儒，博通史、子，流連文藝，沈吟道奧。泰始之朝，掛冠辭世，遁捨家業，隱于太平。葺宇窮巖，採芝幽澗，耦耕自足，薪歌有餘。確爾不羣，淡然寡欲，麻衣藿食，二十餘載。雖古之志士，何以加之。謂宜釋巾幽谷，結組登朝，則喦谷含懽，薜蘿起抃矣。」不報。建武初，徵員外散騎侍郎，京產曰：「莊生持釣，豈爲白璧所回。」辭疾不就。年六十四，永元元年，卒。",